Micropolis for Debian
=====================

This package is built from the current master branch of the original
SimHacker/micropolis repository, snapshot at commit c98f6b0 from 2026-02-10.
The classic X11/Tcl/Tk implementation packaged here lives in the
micropolis-activity subtree of that repository.

The packaging is a clean modernization of Debian's historical 2007-snapshot
package.  It deliberately keeps the old binary package names and game data
locations for compatibility, while rebuilding with current Debian toolchain
flags and fixing modern compiler issues.

The bundled Tcl 6.x, Tk 2.x and TclX sources are part of this historical game.
They are intentionally built privately into the simulator rather than replaced
with current system Tcl/Tk, because doing so would be a source port rather than
a packaging update.

